{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43204","headline":"晚至乡亭 · 郑德玄","name":"晚至乡亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长亭日已暮，驻马暂盘桓。\n山川杳不极，徒侣默相看。\n云夕荆台暗，风秋郢路寒。\n客心一如此，谁复采芳兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑德玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}